<note>
<title>One image placed at several sizes</title>
<content><![CDATA[<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd"><en-note><div>Original size:</div><div><en-media hash="5fae300a506d0728745732c6a6bc4e81" type="image/png" style="--en-naturalWidth:128; --en-naturalHeight:128;" /></div><div>Resized:</div><div><en-media hash="5fae300a506d0728745732c6a6bc4e81" type="image/png" style="--en-naturalWidth:128; --en-naturalHeight:128;" width="50px" /></div><div>Resized to a fraction of a pixel:</div><div><en-media hash="5fae300a506d0728745732c6a6bc4e81" type="image/png" width="40.5px" /></div><div>Given both measurements:</div><div><en-media hash="5fae300a506d0728745732c6a6bc4e81" type="image/png" width="300" height="60" /></div><div>Sized by the clipped page's own style, which overrides the attribute beside it:</div><div><en-media hash="5fae300a506d0728745732c6a6bc4e81" type="image/png" style="display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;" width="1" /></div></en-note>]]></content>
<created>20250310T101500Z</created>
<updated>20250311T081200Z</updated>
<resource><data encoding="base64">iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mP8//8/AwAFAAEKLrTnAAAAAElFTkSuQmCC</data><mime>image/png</mime>
<resource-attributes><file-name>dot.png</file-name></resource-attributes></resource>
</note>
